flowchart TB
  Reviewer[Recruiter / technical manager] --> GitHub[GitHub repository, CI and evidence]
  Engineer[Engineer in Dev Container] --> GitHub
  GitHub -->|OIDC| WIF[Workload Identity Federation]
  WIF --> Terraform[Layered Terraform]
  GitHub --> Build[Cloud Build]
  Build --> Registry[Artifact Registry]
  Build --> Provenance[SBOM, provenance and attestation]
  Provenance --> BinAuth[Binary Authorization]
  Build --> Deploy[Cloud Deploy]

  subgraph GCP[Dedicated ephemeral Google Cloud project]
    subgraph Net[Custom VPC]
      Subnet[Private GKE subnet + Pod/Service ranges]
      PGA[Private Google Access]
      Flow[VPC Flow Logs]
      NAT[Optional Cloud NAT]
      PSA[Private Service Access]
    end
    subgraph Cluster[Private GKE Standard]
      System[On-demand system pool]
      Spot[Optional Spot app pool]
      Policy[Dataplane V2, RBAC, PSA, quotas, PDBs]
      OTel[OpenTelemetry + Managed Prometheus]
      Staging[Staging API + worker]
      Production[Production API + worker]
      Echo[HTTP/HTTPS echo]
      Hello[GKE hello-app]
      HPA[HPA CPU example]
      Stateful[StatefulSet + Persistent Disk]
    end
    Edge[Global GKE Gateway / load balancer]
    Armor[Cloud Armor]
    Secrets[Secret Manager]
    PubSub[Pub/Sub + DLQ]
    Results[GCS results]
    PrivateDNS[Cloud DNS private zone]
    SQL[Optional Cloud SQL PostgreSQL]
    Backup[Optional Backup for GKE]
    Ops[Logging, Monitoring and Trace]
  end

  Deploy --> Staging
  Deploy -->|approved promotion| Production
  BinAuth -. admission .-> Policy
  DNS[nip.io temporary DNS] --> Edge
  ACME[Let's Encrypt] --> Cert[cert-manager]
  Cert --> Edge
  Armor --> Edge
  Edge --> Production
  Edge --> Echo
  Edge --> Hello
  Production --> PubSub
  Staging --> PubSub
  PubSub --> Staging
  PubSub --> Production
  Staging --> Results
  Production --> Results
  Staging --> Secrets
  Production --> Secrets
  Production -. data profile .-> SQL
  PSA --> SQL
  Stateful -. recovery profile .-> Backup
  Cluster --> Ops
  OTel --> Ops
  Subnet --> PrivateDNS
